  "description": "Certificate of lawful development (existing): Establish use of property as three self contained flats (1 X 1 bed and 2 X studio)",
  "development_type": "Certificates of Lawful Development",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nLocal Planning Authority is not satisfied that consistent evidence has been\r\nprovided to demonstrate that, on the balance of probabilities, the 3 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;self-contained units&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt; &lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;at 68 Vancouver Road, Edgware,\r\nHarrow, HA8 5DH, is immune from enforcement action as per Section 171.B of The\r\nTown and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). The existing development is\r\ntherefore considered to be unlawful and as such the Local Planning Authority\r\nrefuse to issue a Certificate of Lawful Existing Development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
